# FLOWX n type low period   (a random node: 0 boolean, 1 byte, 2 integer, 3 float)
MFLOW 2
NAME Shipping dock & order pickers
POPUP 1 2 2 How it works
POPUPTEXT 1 Three order pickers take boxes from their\nracks and put them on the roller conveyor.\nClick SB1: it carries them to the dock; the\ndock worker lifts each one into the box van.\nPE1 counts what is shipped.
POPUP 2 0 3 Try this
POPUPTEXT 2 Click SB0: the line stops and the boxes wait\nat the pickers. Select a picker: Every s,\nwhat it loads. Make the dock worker a slow\none (Carry s): the line backs up.

